1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,288
Here's where the story gets interesting.

2
00:00:03,338 --> 00:00:07,508
According to Ramesses himself, everyone abandoned him.

3
00:00:07,558 --> 00:00:13,428
So he prayed to the god Amun, climbed into his chariot, and charged the enemy.

4
00:00:13,478 --> 00:00:14,608
Alone.

5
00:00:14,658 --> 00:00:16,488
Again and again.

6
00:00:16,538 --> 00:00:19,788
Defeating thousands with his own hands.

7
00:00:19,878 --> 00:00:21,988
That's his version.

8
00:00:22,038 --> 00:00:26,068
The temple carvings even show his pet lion in the camp.

9
00:00:26,118 --> 00:00:27,988
Historians are a little skeptical.

